温暖质感，特写，兔子先生打开门，惊喜地接过信，耳朵竖起来，递给小松鼠一根胡萝卜\n8. 治愈童话风插画，马卡龙色调，软质笔触，可爱 Q 版，明亮柔和光影，森林场景，温暖质感，近景，小松鼠坐在树桩上啃胡萝卜，旁边放着空空的邮包，阳光落在它身上\n9. 治愈童话风插画，马卡龙色调，软质笔触，可爱 Q 版，明亮柔和光影，森林场景，温暖质感，全景，傍晚的森林，小松鼠背着空邮包往家走，天边是粉橙色的晚霞，画面温暖治愈"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [506.1533508300781, 369.2239990234375], "pos": [2205.562255859375, -393.97265625], "id": 64, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "int_1", "links": [89], "label": "int_1", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "int_1"}, {"name": "float_1", "label": "float_1", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "float_1"}, {"name": "int_2", "links": [90], "label": "int_2", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "int_2"}, {"name": "float_2", "label": "float_2", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "float_2"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["((a*min(1,2048/max(a,b))+15)//16)*16", "((b*min(1,2048/max(a,b))+15)//16)*16"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "a", "link": 130, "label": "a", "type": "*", "localized_name": "a"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "b", "link": 132, "label": "b", "type": "*", "localized_name": "b"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "c", "label": "c", "type": "*", "localized_name": "c"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "d", "label": "d", "type": "*", "localized_name": "d"}, {"widget": {"name": "value_1"}, "name": "value_1", "label": "value_1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "value_2"}, "name": "value_2", "label": "value_2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value_2"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false, "disabled": false}, "type": "SimpleMathDual+", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [270, 15